+
+### subscribe(event, fn, context?)
+
+Returns an idempotent `unsubscribe(): void` for exactly this persistent registration.
+Unlike `off`, it preserves other registrations with identical callbacks/context.
+Removing and re-registering does not let an old cancellation remove the new listener.
+Cancellation affects subsequent emits; the current emit retains its existing snapshot.
